  "raw_html": "<main id=\"main-content\"><div><section class=\"bg-white dark:bg-background pt-28 pb-20 lg:pt-36 lg:pb-28\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity:0;will-change:opacity,transform;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-4\">About School of Core AI</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-foreground leading-tight\">Built for Engineers. <span class=\"brand\">Designed for Real AI Work.</span></h1><p class=\"mt-6 text-[16px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto\">SCAI is an AI engineering institution focused on applied capability — not just credentials. We train professionals who think in systems, build with precision, and contribute meaningfully to production AI environments.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4\"><a class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-foreground text-background text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition\" href=\"/courses/\">Explore Programs</a><a class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-border text-foreground text-sm font-medium hover:bg-accent transition\" href=\"/contact-us/\">Talk to Our Team</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mb-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Who We Are</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground max-w-2xl\">An institution built around <span class=\"brand\">applied AI capability</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">School of Core AI was founded on a single observation: most AI education teaches tools without building judgment. SCAI is structured differently \\u2014 around systems thinking, applied execution, and the kind of depth that matters when you are working on real problems.</p></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">Principle</p><p class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\">Engineering-First</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Every program at SCAI is built around how AI actually works in production — not how it is simplified for introductory courses. Learners engage with real systems, real constraints, and real implementation challenges from the start.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">Principle</p><p class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\">Practitioner-Led</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Our instructors are active practitioners across AI engineering, data science, MLOps, and applied research. They bring context that only comes from building and deploying real systems at scale.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">Principle</p><p class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\">Outcome-Oriented</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">SCAI programs are structured around what learners need to accomplish — not just what topics need to be covered. Progression is measured by capability, clarity, and technical confidence.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white dark:bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Our Impact</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">Numbers that reflect <span class=\"brand\">real outcomes</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] text-muted-foreground max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Across cohorts, corporate engagements, and applied projects — SCAI has built a track record grounded in measurable progress.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5\"><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card text-center flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">1,200+</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-snug\">Learners Trained</p></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card text-center flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">100+</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-snug\">Corporate Training Sessions</p></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card text-center flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">160+</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-snug\">AI Projects Completed</p></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card text-center flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">150+</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-snug\">Hiring Partners</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Differentiators</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">What makes SCAI <span class=\"brand\">structurally different</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] text-muted-foreground max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">SCAI is not structured like a typical training institute. The differences are deliberate and reflect a clear position on what rigorous AI education actually requires.</p></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">What sets us apart</p><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Production-Oriented Curriculum</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-3\">Programs are structured around how AI is actually built and deployed — covering systems design, model management, monitoring, and real-world debugging alongside the core fundamentals.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">What sets us apart</p><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">MLOps &amp; LLMOps as Core Tracks</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-3\">SCAI integrates MLOps, LLMOps, and AIOps as first-class tracks, not optional add-ons. These are standard in modern AI roles and are treated as such across every program.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">What sets us apart</p><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Structured Applied Projects</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-3\">Every program includes project work that requires architectural decisions, debugging, and iterative refinement — not toy examples. This is what builds genuine implementation confidence.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">What sets us apart</p><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Agentic AI &amp; Modern Stacks</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-3\">SCAI covers Agentic AI frameworks, LLM pipelines, vector stores, and retrieval-augmented generation as part of its current curriculum — reflecting what the industry is actively building with today.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">What sets us apart</p><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Practitioner Mentorship</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-3\">Learning at SCAI is supported by active practitioners, not just instructors. Mentors bring applied judgment into sessions, helping learners work through decisions, not just consume content.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">What sets us apart</p><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Corporate-Validated Depth</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-3\">SCAI’s curriculum aligns with how AI capability is evaluated in enterprise settings. Programs are designed so learners can contribute meaningfully from the moment they step into a professional environment.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white dark:bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Direction</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">Vision, Mission &amp; <span class=\"brand\">Commitment</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">Vision</p><p class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">A world where AI capability is built through rigorous practice, not compressed shortcuts.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-4\">SCAI envisions an ecosystem where learners emerge not just certified, but genuinely equipped — with the judgment, depth, and technical fluency to work on AI systems that matter.</p></div><div class=\"p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">Mission</p><p class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">To build practitioners who think clearly, build confidently, and contribute from day one.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-4\">Our mission is to close the gap between AI education and AI execution. Every program, every mentor session, and every project is structured with that gap in mind.</p></div><div class=\"p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">Commitment</p><p class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Structured learning. Real mentorship. Honest outcomes.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-4\">SCAI commits to intellectual rigor, practical relevance, and transparent positioning. We do not overpromise. We build programs around what learners actually need to succeed.</p></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"py-20 bg-white dark:bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Recognition</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">Recognized By</h2></div><div class=\"flex justify-center flex-wrap items-center gap-8 mb-16\"><img alt=\"NSDC\" class=\"h-14 w-auto object-contain\" data-nimg=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"214\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/_next/static/media/recognize_1.10327505.svg\" style=\"color:transparent\" width=\"547\"/><img alt=\"Government\" class=\"h-14 w-auto object-contain\" data-nimg=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"164\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/_next/static/media/recognize_2.d585f242.svg\" style=\"color:transparent\" width=\"393\"/><img alt=\"Startup India\" class=\"h-14 w-auto object-contain\" data-nimg=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"189\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/_next/static/media/recognize_3.f29ab137.svg\" style=\"color:transparent\" width=\"469\"/></div><div class=\"text-center mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Ecosystem</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">Our Strategic Collaborators</h2></div><div cla